ulate genetic probability with a Punnett square and evaluate its limits.</p><p><strong>My feedback was …</strong> Name what you heard at Review.</p><p><strong>Next I need to …</strong> Check the top and side alleles before giving a chance.</p><p><strong>How I know:</strong> I can fill Aa × aa and explain that two of four model squares are aa, with no promise about real offspring.</p><p>Your teacher hears your answer and uses it to choose our next model, prompt or example.</p><p data-mbm-guide>Hear the answer privately in a valid mode and use it to change the next example or prompt.</p></section></main><footer><p>Offline lesson · no answers or scores are stored.</p></footer><script>"use strict";(()=>{const form=document.getElementById('match-form'),out=document.getElementById('match-feedback');document.getElementById('match-check').addEventListener('click',()=>{let blanks=0,good=0;form.querySelectorAll('select').forEach(s=>{const answer=s.closest('[data-answer]').dataset.answer;if(!s.value){blanks++;s.nextElementSibling.textContent='Choose a match.'}else if(s.value===answer){good++;s.nextElementSibling.textContent='That fits. Explain why.'}else s.nextElementSibling.textContent='Check the model and try again.'});out.textContent=blanks?'Choose a match for each card.':good===form.querySelectorAll('select').length?'All matched. Tell a partner your reason.':'Use the model to repair a match.'});document.getElementById('match-reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{form.reset();form.querySelectorAll('output').forEach(x=>x.textContent='');out.textContent='Ready to match.';form.querySelector('select').focus()});})();</script></body></html>
